  "implementation": [
    "Optional PG selectAndBind completes binding before final Redis slot settlement; legacy custom scheduler explicit binding path remains.",
    "A raw PG losing proposal returns a typed single locked active winner before mutation; inconsistent references, malformed rows, key compatibility, CAS and storage errors retain fail-closed blocks.",
    "Only exact own data hint fields are consumed; inherited/accessor/extra-key hints do not trigger recovery.",
    "The original source/scope/attempted filters and fresh eligibility/health/concurrency/window checks constrain one known winner; one final ordinary fenced bind, no weighted redraw or loop.",
    "All temporary nonwinner slots release after the combined operation; terminal failure releases all tracked slots, and release errors prevent allow.",
    "Preparation validates the final candidate and refreshes account/credential/member facts before original admission/funds guards."
  ],
